					<u>Schwyser</u>
					647.28
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Cyme</span>); <i>appreciation</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				721.25
			</span></i> (Crete, found at Delos).</div>
